<title>GERMANY: German Jan/Oct 1996 coffee imports higher.</title>
<headline>German Jan/Oct 1996 coffee imports higher.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German net green coffee imports from outside the EU totalled 9.89 million bags in January-October 1996 compared with 9.58 million bags in the same period a year earlier, the DKV coffee association said.</p>
<p>Imports of 1.11 million bags in October 1996 exceeded those in October 1995 at 955,169 and 1.05 million bags in September 1996.</p>
<p>Colombia shipped 208,979 bags in October after 182,175 bags in September, Brazil 143,815 (119,833), El Salvador 95,902 (103,935), Papua New Guinea 103,304 (101,214) and Indonesia 87,241 (86,153).</p>
<p>--Hamburg newsroom +49-40-41903275</p>
